<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37596" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξορκ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξορκόω</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				54.26
			</span></i> (codd., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-οῦντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Harp.
				</span></i>
			), <i><span class="en">
				<u>PRev.Laws</u>
				56.12
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				3.61.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>GDI</u>
				5075.25
			</span></i> (Crete, <span class="entity">i B.C.</span>), etc.: c. dupl. acc., <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				524.29
			</span></i> (Crete, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>):—
				Pass.
			, ib.<i><span class="en">
				46.6
			</span></i> (Halic., <span class="entity">v B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				6.26.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1346
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>conjure,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. σε κύριον τὸν θεόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ge.</u>
					24.3
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMag.Lond.</u>
				121.269
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. [τινὰ] τοῖς μεγάλοις
				ὀνόμασιν</span> ib. <i><span class="en">
				892
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. σε κατὰ τοῦ θεοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
					26.63
				</span></i>
			; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰ κατά τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PMag.Par.</u>
					1.356
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>exorcise</i> an evil spirit, <u>Tab.Defix.</u> in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Rh.Mus.</u>
				55.248
			</span></i>.</div>
